("v5", "key", "commonPrompt")
("v6", "type", "String")
("v6", "scalar", "Use case: illustration-story. Create one bespoke high-quality widescreen PNG website hero, landscape 16:9, painterly cinematic editorial illustration, luminous daylight, fine tactile materials and atmospheric depth. This is a fictional symbolic landscape for a personal essay, not a photograph of the author or his actual family. No lettering, typography, UI, logos, watermarks, or legible writing. Composition: visually quiet pale negative space across the left 45% for a dark headline; richly composed meaningful scene concentrated on the right, main focal objects at 65–85% width; keep scene readable when cropped on mobile. Elegant, hopeful, deeply humane, grounded rather than kitschy. ")
("v5", "value", "v6")
